{
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false
  },
  "name": "LGM \u2014 Sync each message to Attio (find or create person + log the message)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "3f0ea449-269b-4717-9667-a0d2b0b88e69",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -560,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 470,
        "content": "## Sync each LGM message to Attio\n\n### How it works\n\n1. The **LGM Trigger** fires on every inbox message (LinkedIn or Email, sent or received).\n2. One Attio query looks the person up by **email, full name, or LinkedIn URL**.\n3. If no one matches, the person is **created** in Attio.\n4. The person is **updated** with the latest data from LGM.\n5. The message is appended as a **dated note** (Attio has no native message object, so a note is the clean fit).\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- [ ] Create a **La Growth Machine API** credential (Settings \u2192 API in LGM).\n- [ ] Create an **Attio (Header Auth)** credential: header `Authorization`, value `Bearer <your Attio key>`.\n- [ ] Activate the workflow so the LGM inbox webhook registers automatically.\n\n### Customization\n\n- Attribute slugs (`job_title`, `linkedin`, `email_addresses`, `description`) vary by workspace \u2014 adjust the JSON bodies to match yours.\n- Drop the `linkedin` filter in *Attio: find person* if your workspace has no such attribute.\n- Restrict the trigger to specific campaigns with its **Campaign IDs** field."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "73c27775-7d34-47eb-8fd4-42ce9779566c",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -40,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 660,
        "height": 360,
        "content": "## 1. Receive the message and find the person\n\nThe LGM Trigger emits the message, the lead record and the conversation context. A single Attio query matches the person by email, full name or LinkedIn URL."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "f965fde5-f541-4320-83a7-e73d0cd612d1",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        700,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 400,
        "height": 560,
        "content": "## 2. Find or create the record\n\nIf the person already exists, keep their record ID. If not, create them in Attio, then carry the new record ID forward \u2014 both paths converge on one ID."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "4813867f-7f72-478a-b133-7e491f20932a",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1160,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 460,
        "height": 360,
        "content": "## 3. Update the person and log the message\n\nRefresh the person with the latest LGM data, then append the message as a dated note so the whole conversation history lives on the Attio record."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "trigger",
      "name": "LGM Trigger (message)",
      "type": "@lagrowthmachine/n8n-nodes-lagrowthmachine.laGrowthMachineTrigger",
      "position": [
        0,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {},
      "credentials": {
        "laGrowthMachineApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ME",
          "name": "La Growth Machine account"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "find",
      "name": "Attio: find person",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [
        240,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://api.attio.com/v2/objects/people/records/query",
        "method": "POST",
        "options": {},
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ filter: { $or: [ { email_addresses: $json.lead.email }, { name: { full_name: ($json.lead.firstName + ' ' + $json.lead.lastName) } }, { linkedin: $json.lead.linkedin } ] }, limit: 1 }) }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth"
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ME",
          "name": "Attio API (Header Auth)"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.2
    },
    {
      "id": "exists",
      "name": "Person exists?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "position": [
        480,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "version": 2,
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gt"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.data.length }}",
              "rightValue": 0
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "use-existing",
      "name": "Use existing record",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        720,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "r1",
              "name": "record_id",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.data[0].id.record_id }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "id": "create",
      "name": "Attio: create person",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [
        720,
        440
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://api.attio.com/v2/objects/people/records",
        "method": "POST",
        "options": {},
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ data: { values: { name: [{ first_name: $('LGM Trigger (message)').item.json.lead.firstName, last_name: $('LGM Trigger (message)').item.json.lead.lastName, full_name: ($('LGM Trigger (message)').item.json.lead.firstName + ' ' + $('LGM Trigger (message)').item.json.lead.lastName) }], email_addresses: [$('LGM Trigger (message)').item.json.lead.email], job_title: $('LGM Trigger (message)').item.json.lead.jobTitle } } }) }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth"
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ME",
          "name": "Attio API (Header Auth)"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.2
    },
    {
      "id": "use-new",
      "name": "Use new record",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        960,
        440
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "r2",
              "name": "record_id",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.data.id.record_id }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "id": "update",
      "name": "Attio: update person",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [
        1200,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=https://api.attio.com/v2/objects/people/records/{{ $json.record_id }}",
        "method": "PATCH",
        "options": {},
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ data: { values: { job_title: $('LGM Trigger (message)').item.json.lead.jobTitle, description: $('LGM Trigger (message)').item.json.lead.shortBio } } }) }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth"
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ME",
          "name": "Attio API (Header Auth)"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.2
    },
    {
      "id": "note-attio",
      "name": "Attio: add dated note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [
        1440,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://api.attio.com/v2/notes",
        "method": "POST",
        "options": {},
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ data: { parent_object: 'people', parent_record_id: $json.data.id.record_id, title: ($('LGM Trigger (message)').item.json.messageChannel + ' message ' + ($('LGM Trigger (message)').item.json.received ? 'received' : 'sent') + ' on ' + $now.toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm')), format: 'plaintext', content: $('LGM Trigger (message)').item.json.messageBody } }) }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth"
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ME",
          "name": "Attio API (Header Auth)"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.2
    }
  ],
